            <span class=\"middle inline-block h100\"></span>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <span class=\"middle inline-block h100\"></span>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div id=\"header\" role=\"banner\" data-notranslate>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"banner-load\">\r\n    <a href=\"https://www.pmi.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" border=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n        <img src=\"/Public/Custom/8961/6x3_PMI_IMAGE.jpg\" alt=\"PMI-design\" id=\"PMI-banner\" />\r\n    </a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"logo\">\r\n        <div id=\"Logo\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://www.pmi.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                <img src=\"/Public/Custom/8961/pmi_mb_logo.jpg\" alt=\"PMILogo\" id=\"PMI-logo\" />\r\n            </a>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\r\n                \r\n\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"alert alert-info\" aria-live=\"polite\"><button class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"alert\">&times;</button>You attempted to access a category that has expired and is no longer available.</div>\r\n\t\r\n                \r\n\r\n\r\n<div id=\"categories\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"general-guidelines info panel blackbox\">\r\n        <div data-notranslate data-linkify class=\"guidelines-text\"><div class=\"clearfix\"><p><strong>Share your knowledge. Inspire project professionals worldwide.</strong></p><p>PMI is powered by a global community of practitioners who contribute ideas, lessons learned, and real-world experiences. Whether you're submitting an article, webinar, template, or other resource, your expertise can help project professionals overcome challenges, discover new approaches, and achieve better outcomes.</p><p>We encourage contributors from all backgrounds and experience levels to participate. Please review the submission requirements carefully before submitting your content, as incomplete submissions may not be considered.</p><p>We look forward to helping you share your knowledge with the global PMI community.</p></div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"category panel-btn relative  \" data-go=\"/login?returnUrl=%2Fsubmit%2F368119%2Fprojectmanagement-com-article-submissions\">\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block middle h100\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block middle title-column\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"header-3 word-wrap\" id=\"ProjectManagement.com---Article-Submissions\">\r\n                            <a target=\"_top\" href=\"/login?returnUrl=%2Fsubmit%2F368119%2Fprojectmanagement-com-article-submissions\" data-notranslate>ProjectManagement.com - Article Submissions</a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block fee-column hidden-md-down\">\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"btn-group middle more-column dropdown\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn sbm-btn-nav-01\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#category-description-368119\">\r\n                            <span class=\"sr-only\">Guidelines for <span data-notranslate>ProjectManagement.com - Article Submissions</span></span>\r\n                            <span class=\"inline-block middle semibold\">Guidelines</span>\r\n                            <span class=\"submitticon-dropdown-down right-icon\"></span>\r\n                        </button>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block middle submit-column\">\r\n                        <a class=\"btn org-primary link-color-inverted\" target=\"_top\" href=\"/login?returnUrl=%2Fsubmit%2F368119%2Fprojectmanagement-com-article-submissions\">\r\n                            <span class=\"hidden-md-down\">\r\n                                    <span>Submit</span>\r\n                            </span>\r\n                            <span class=\"hidden-md-up middle submitticon-next\"></span>\r\n                            <span class=\"inline-block h100 middle\"></span>\r\n                            <span class=\"sr-only\" data-notranslate>to ProjectManagement.com - Article Submissions</span>\r\n                        </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n                <div id=\"category-description-368119\" class=\"collapse\">\r\n                    <div data-notranslate data-linkify class=\"category-description\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"ProjectManagement.com---Article-Submissions\"><p>To submit an article or template to ProjectManagement.com, we ask that you complete the following steps before submitting. These steps are to maximize your chances of success and ensure we can move your content quickly from submission to publication, if your article or template is accepted. Please make sure to complete the following:</p>\n<ol>\n  <li>We ask all submitters to register and complete a free PMI profile. You can find the account creation page <a href=\"https://idp.pmi.org/register?clientId=pmcomclient&amp;returnUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.projectmanagement.com%2Floginpmiprocess.cfm%3Fgoto%3D%252Fcontentpages%252Fpage%252Ecfm%253FID%253D192846%26reg%3Dnew&amp;_gl=1*be4ks5*_gcl_au*MjE4NDc2NDcuMTc4OTQwOTkyNw..\" target=\"_blank\"><u><strong>here.</strong></u></a> If you have any trouble creating your account, please reach out to support@pmi.org.&nbsp;</li>\n  <li>Review the ProjectManagement.com article submission guidelines, found <a href=\"https://www.projectmanagement.com/pdf/SubmissionGuidelines2026A.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><u><strong>here.</strong></u></a></li>\n  <li>Review ProjectManagement.com's priority topics <a href=\"https://www.projectmanagement.com/topics/\" target=\"_blank\"><u><strong>here.</strong></u></a> You are welcome to submit on any topic, but knowing which topics are a priority at this time may help your content fit into our editorial calendar more easily.</li>\n  <li>Review our <a href=\"https://www.projectmanagement.com/articles/1145992/20-must-read-articles-from-2025\" target=\"_blank\"><u><strong>Top 20 Articles from 2025</strong></u></a>. Knowing what has been successful on ProjectManagement.com will help you understand the quality and style of writing our team is looking for. If you have any questions about this, please reach out to PMICommunityContent@pmi.org.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>We encourage you to complete these steps before submitting your content to help you understand ProjectManagement.com's content better, recognize the type of content we are actively seeking, and make the submission process as easy as possible for our community members.</p></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            <div class=\"category panel-btn relative  \" data-go=\"/login?returnUrl=%2Fsubmit%2F371902%2Fprojectmanagement-com-webinar-submissions\">\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block middle h100\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block middle title-column\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"header-3 word-wrap\" id=\"ProjectManagement.com---Webinar-Submissions\">\r\n                            <a target=\"_top\" href=\"/login?returnUrl=%2Fsubmit%2F371902%2Fprojectmanagement-com-webinar-submissions\" data-notranslate>ProjectManagement.com - Webinar Submissions</a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block fee-column hidden-md-down\">\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"btn-group middle more-column dropdown\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn sbm-btn-nav-01\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#category-description-371902\">\r\n                            <span class=\"sr-only\">Guidelines for <span data-notranslate>ProjectManagement.com - Webinar Submissions</span></span>\r\n                            <span class=\"inline-block middle semibold\">Guidelines</span>\r\n                            <span class=\"submitticon-dropdown-down right-icon\"></span>\r\n                        </button>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"inline-block middle submit-column\">\r\n                        <a class=\"btn org-primary link-color-inverted\" target=\"_top\" href=\"/login?returnUrl=%2Fsubmit%2F371902%2Fprojectmanagement-com-webinar-submissions\">\r\n                            <span class=\"hidden-md-down\">\r\n                                    <span>Submit</span>\r\n                            </span>\r\n                            <span class=\"hidden-md-up middle submitticon-next\"></span>\r\n                            <span class=\"inline-block h100 middle\"></span>\r\n                            <span class=\"sr-only\" data-notranslate>to ProjectManagement.com - Webinar Submissions</span>\r\n                        </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n                <div id=\"category-description-371902\" class=\"collapse\">\r\n                    <div data-notranslate data-linkify class=\"category-description\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"ProjectManagement.com---Webinar-Submissions\"><p>To submit a webinar to ProjectManagement.com, we ask that you complete the following steps before submitting. These steps are to maximize your chances of success and ensure we can move your content quickly from submission to publication, if your article or template is accepted. Please make sure to complete the following:</p>\n<ol>\n  <li>We ask all submitters to register and complete a free PMI profile. You can find the account creation page <a href=\"https://idp.pmi.org/register?clientId=pmcomclient&amp;returnUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.projectmanagement.com%2Floginpmiprocess.cfm%3Fgoto%3D%252Fcontentpages%252Fpage%252Ecfm%253FID%253D192846%26reg%3Dnew&amp;_gl=1*be4ks5*_gcl_au*MjE4NDc2NDcuMTc4OTQwOTkyNw..\" target=\"_blank\"><u><strong>here.</strong></u></a> If you have any trouble creating your account, please reach out to support@pmi.org.&nbsp;</li>\n  <li>Review the ProjectManagement.com Webinar Presenter Pack, found <a href=\"https://na.eventscloud.com/website/84029/?_gl=1*dz4c11*_gcl_au*MjE4NDc2NDcuMTc4OTQwOTkyNw..\" target=\"_blank\"><u><strong>here.</strong></u></a></li>\n  <li>Review ProjectManagement.com's priority topics <a href=\"https://www.projectmanagement.com/topics/\" target=\"_blank\"><u><strong>here.</strong></u></a> You are welcome to submit on any topic, but knowing which topics are a priority at this time may help your content fit into our editorial calendar more easily.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>We encourage you to complete these steps before submitting your content to help you understand ProjectManagement.com's content better, recognize the type of content we are actively seeking, and make the submission process as easy as possible for our community members.</p></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n        <footer id=\"footer\" data-notranslate>\r\n            \r\n\r\n<div id=\"footer-no-custom\" class=\"sbm-pub-navbar\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"footer-left-side\">\r\n        <span class=\"footer-links middle\" role=\"list\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://www.submittable.com/help/submitter?orgId=8961\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"feedback-link hidden-md-down link-color middle submitticon-maybe mr10\"></span>Technical Help</a>\r\n            <span class=\"ml10 mr10\">|</span>\r\n            <a href=\"https://www.submittable.com/privacy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a>\r\n        </span>\r\n\r\n        <span class=\"middle inline-block h100\"></span>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"footer-right-side\">\r\n\r\n        <span id=\"powered-by-submittable-link\"></span>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n        </footer>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"ajax-modal\" class=\